Cell["\<\
Optional diagnostic: the following commented-out code specializes the W34 \
Gram-matrix analysis to Nd = 4, where the 95-element projection set is \
dependent. Keep this diagnostic separate from the main calculation, which \
retains symbolic Nd. Uncomment the diagnostic commands to evaluate them.\
\>", "Text",
