Cell["\<\
We solve the equations sequentially, in an order chosen for efficiency, \
storing the coefficients found at each step for use in the next. The first \
equation is W31, which involves only the coefficients of the quadratic kernel \
K^{phi phi}. We obtain:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995700273593787*^9, 3.995700294338223*^9}, {
  3.9957008190418377`*^9, 3.995700915050037*^9}, {3.9957087816413183`*^9, 
  3.9957087830901012`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a86b425a-1a32-4f27-87c8-\
c5ca95005635"],

