    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ac9182f7-bc9e-44be-bf9c-0e83e185752c"],
 " is defined below. The function M implemented here is M(eta), with all \
displayed indices raised using eta; only its metric-density factor is \
replaced by phi in the later cubic comparison."
}], "Text",
