Cell["\<\
The identities leave cGG free. We set cGG = 1/(Nd-1) to match the \
normalization of Brandt and McKeon, arXiv:1601.04944, Eq. (3.6), for which \
KGG = M(eta)/2. This is a normalization choice, not a further consequence of \
the identities.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995705132329731*^9, 3.9957051395288153`*^9}, {
